## Article 16 & 17. Access to Personal Data

```catala
declaration scope AccessRequests:
  input isRequestByDataSubject content YesNo
  input requestProcessingDays content integer
  output responseDeadlineDays content integer
  output resolutionDeadlineDays content integer
  output isFreeOfCharge content YesNo

scope AccessRequests:
  # Article 16, Part 5
  definition responseDeadlineDays equals 10
  definition resolutionDeadlineDays equals 30
  
  # Article 19, Part 1
  label default_paid definition isFreeOfCharge equals No
  
  label free_for_subject exception default_paid
  definition isFreeOfCharge under condition
    isRequestByDataSubject = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
